bp?t=1746885608\" width=618 height=54 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981400/extras/7a7b7b603089a0e7e689fe723cd21706.poster.avif?t=1746885608\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981400/extras/7a7b7b603089a0e7e689fe723cd21706.webm?t=1746885608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981400/extras/7a7b7b603089a0e7e689fe723cd21706.mp4?t=1746885608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Crafting should be fun. Immerse yourself in detailed crafting based on real historical methods. Gather raw materials from the world around you, then transform them using the techniques of the time \u2013 grind grain into flour with a quern-stone, knap flint into an axe head, or smelt and forge an iron sword blade.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981400/extras/31c6b4971618c17318356f2e4f205dec.webp?t=1746885608\" width=618 height=54 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981400/extras/33a98a7ddaa842c18596a401b1b78b2d.poster.avif?t=1746885608\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981400/extras/33a98a7ddaa842c18596a401b1b78b2d.webm?t=1746885608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981400/extras/33a98a7ddaa842c18596a401b1b78b2d.mp4?t=1746885608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Survival in the harsh medieval world requires foresight and preparation. You can't simply take nature's bounty for granted \u2013 the ability to plan ahead a